//--I Am Legion - Reborn - Mod Config
//COMMENT Welcome and thank you for downloading and supporting I Am Legion Reborn for Dying Light. You can utilize the above sections to enhance the game and modify IAL to fit your ideal playstyle. Please make sure to check out the IALR Configs on the left, as these will allow you to immediately load in the different difficulty settings and modify them to your own preferences.
//--IALR Discord Channel
//LOCATION https://discord.gg/HbTvgxKCRk
//COMMENT This mod wouldn't be possible without the feedback and support the community has offered. If you have not joined the Discord community but are curious about the latest news and tech support for this mod, please make sure to drop by the Discord and let me know your feedback.

//--IALR Config Share
//LOCATION https://discord.com/channels/938426300362784788/1055204891989114970
//COMMENT If you would like to share your config with others, you can use the "Share Config" button to be directed to the file location of your unique config. Feel free to share this config on the IALR Discord - ialr-config-share board with some descriptions of your custom settings so others can enjoy your work. Thanks for downloading and happy gaming.

//{MOD SUPPORT}
//--IALR Mod Support
//COMMENT This mod was created on Apr 8th, 2015 by DocOnHoliday and consisted of over 400 updates to the mod with thousands of hours of development for updates and new features designed with feedback from the Dying Light Community. Additionally, this mod has been taken even further in 2022 with Dying Light 2 with hundreds of updates and thousands of hours of support and development. If you would like to support the mods development or are interested in the exclusive content for this mod, make sure to check out the Patreon page to find out more about the supporters content developed for the mod.
//--IALR Patreon Support Page
//LOCATION https://www.patreon.com/DocOnHoliday

